WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
A pencil house at dusk: pale walls, cool shadows, and warm windows.

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.400
Draw a graphite detail on the saved front-wall guide.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.400
Select the new detail, move it, then undo and redo.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.200
Orbit to reveal the shaded side and roof depth.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.400
Export the artwork still, save, and reopen the editable drawing.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Finish with the artwork-only view. Input is synthetic and has no pressure data.
